</section>
<section class="chat" id="chat">
<h2>Chat with the reviewer <span class="dim">run 1 · paste into a terminal</span>
</h2>
<div class="copyrow">
<pre id="chat-command">$EXE chat 1 --config '/config/sanic review.toml' --data-dir $DATA</pre>
<button class="btn" type="button" data-copy="#chat-command" aria-describedby="chat-command">Copy</button>
</div>
<p class="note">Checks the review's worktree out again and removes it when the chat ends. Read-only, no GitHub token; add <code>--allow-edits</code> to let it edit that copy.</p>
<details>
<summary>Run claude yourself instead</summary>
<ol>
<li>
<span>Check out the worktree and print the claude line</span>
<div class="copyrow">
<pre id="print-command">$EXE chat --print-command 1 --config '/config/sanic review.toml' --data-dir $DATA</pre>
<button class="btn" type="button" data-copy="#print-command" aria-describedby="print-command">Copy</button>
</div>
</li>
<li>
<span>Run it</span>
<div class="copyrow">
<pre id="claude-command">cd $DATA/worktrees/1 &amp;&amp; env -u GITHUB_TOKEN -u GH_TOKEN -u GITHUB_ENTERPRISE_TOKEN -u GH_ENTERPRISE_TOKEN '/opt/my claude' --resume sess-7 --restricted --strict-mcp-config --tools Read,Grep,Glob --allowedTools Read,Grep,Glob --add-dir $DATA/runs/1 --add-dir /skills/review</pre>
<button class="btn" type="button" data-copy="#claude-command" aria-describedby="claude-command">Copy</button>
</div>
</li>
<li>
<span>Remove the worktree afterwards</span>
<div class="copyrow">
<pre id="cleanup-command">$EXE chat --cleanup 1 --config '/config/sanic review.toml' --data-dir $DATA</pre>
<button class="btn" type="button" data-copy="#cleanup-command" aria-describedby="cleanup-command">Copy</button>
</div>
</li>
</ol>
</details>
</section>
<p class="help-foot">
<span class="k">j</span>
<span class="k">k</span> draft · <span class="k">e</span> edit (<span class="k">Esc</span> saves) · <span class="k">y</span> accept · <span class="k">n</span> reject · <span class="k">u</span> undo · <span class="k">p</span> preview · <span class="k">r</span>
<span class="k">a</span>
<span class="k">i</span>
<span class="k">c</span> act on the PR · <span class="k">q</span> index</p>
</main>
<div class="overlay" id="help" hidden>
<div class="popup">
<h2>Keys</h2>
<table>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>q</kbd>
</th>
<td>close this help; otherwise back to the index</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>Tab, Shift-Tab</kbd>
</th>
<td>next, previous list</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>j/k, Down/Up</kbd>
</th>
<td>move in the list</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>g/G, Home/End</kbd>
</th>
<td>first, last row</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>Enter</kbd>
</th>
<td>open the selected PR</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>r</kbd>
</th>
<td>review now: failed, held or skipped (asks first)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>a</kbd>
</th>
<td>archive or unarchive the selected PR</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>A</kbd>
</th>
<td>show or hide archived PRs</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>i</kbd>
</th>
<td>skip PRs with titles like the selected one</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>c</kbd>
</th>
<td>chat with the agent that reviewed it: shows the command</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>?, Esc</kbd>
</th>
<td>show, close this help</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="dim">On a PR page j/k move between drafts, and r and a act on the PR. On a confirm page y confirms and Esc or q cancels.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="overlay" id="dialog" hidden>
<div class="popup dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
</div>
</div>
<div id="notice" hidden>
</div>
</body>
</html>
